OL,3,AHow long will humans be needed for
OL,4,Atranslation?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Il pleut des cordes," say the French
OL,7,Fwhen it's raining hard.
OL,9,F"It's raining ropes," is the direct
OL,10,Ftranslation. It's the kind of idiom
OL,11,Fwhich can trip up an AI translator.
OL,13,F"You can imagine the dilemma this
OL,14,Fthrows AI into," says Francois Yvon, a
OL,15,Fresearch director specialised in
OL,16,Fautomatic translation with the French
OL,17,FNational Centre for Scientific Research
OL,18,FCNRS.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
